    "description": "Welcome to 1718 20th Avenue, a light-filled 3-bedroom, 3-bathroom home in the heart of the Sunset. Built in 2001 with approx. 2,225 sq. ft., this three-level residence blends comfort and versatility for modern living.    The main floor features an open living and dining area filled with natural light, a spacious kitchen, and the convenience of a bedroom and full bath on the same levelideal for guests, extended family, or a home office. Upstairs, two bedrooms offer restful retreats, including a serene primary suite with en-suite bath and shower and a bonus room ideal for work from home space.    A two-car garage, ample storage, and low-maintenance common areas add everyday ease. Just minutes from Golden Gate Park, Irving Street cafs, shops, and public transit, this home offers the perfect balance of space, convenience, and San Francisco lifestyle.    At 1718 20th Avenue, you'll find not just a home, but a place to live, work, and thrive."
  },
